.TH CUT_DO 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
CUT_DO \- CutStep initializer: call f(e, ctx) once, where ctx is the pointer given to cutscene_start(), then continue immediately
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcutscene.h\(dq
.ft B
#define CUT_DO(f) { .kind = CUT_CALL, .fn = (f) }
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
CutStep initializer: call f(e, ctx) once, where ctx is the pointer given to cutscene_start(), then continue immediately. Use for anything the script needs to change in the game: give an item, set a flag, play a sound, teleport the player.
.SH MODULE
cutscene (src/engine/cutscene/cutscene.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR CutStep (3),
.BR cutscene_start (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
